  "text": "Good morning. This is Paul Adams. Welcome to floor twelve. There are ten desks here, and there is one meeting room. There is a small kitchen too. Your desk is number seven, near the window. There are twelve people in this office today. On Friday there is coffee for everybody at four. Have a good first day.",
